WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,560
Why are you still injured?

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,560
Serious or not

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,560
It's okay. Let's move our things back first.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,980
Just some daily necessities, not heavy

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:11,980
The move was completed in two trips

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:12,980
It's a pity that I didn't find anything to eat

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,430
She is the original girlfriend

8
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:23,630
I used to live in 401 and my name was Wan Xiaolian.

9
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,430
You brought back a lot of things today, right?

10
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:28,030
Can you tell us that we are all neighbors and we can give money?

11
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,430
If you want supplies, go out and find them yourself.

12
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:31,430
No need to play moral kidnapping in front of me

13
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:33,860
You are too cold-blooded, right?

14
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,660
It’s not like we all want just a little bit

15
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,260
And my boyfriend has helped you before

16
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,460
Take you to the supermarket

17
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,060
Aren't you ungrateful now?

18
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:45,380
I paid for the ride at your rubber booth that time and they didn’t dare to come on their own.

19
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,580
I pushed you to come and check it out alone. No one told you.

20
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,780
when i'm really angry

21
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:49,780
Will you be cruel?

22
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:53,670
As it stands now

23
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,470
Our fifteenth floor still needs to be reinforced.
